[I] Make fuzzy comparisons of strings and byte arrays

[T] fstrcmp provides a library which may be used to make fuzzy comparisons
[T] of strings and byte arrays, together with simple commands for use in
[T] shell scripts. The code is derived from the fuzzy comparison functions
[T] of GNU gettext, which in turn come from GNU diff.

[U] https://fstrcmp.sourceforge.net/

[A] Fstrcmp Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

